{"title": "Tenacity", "pageid": 3334, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Tenacity", "categories": ["Weapon actions", "Reactions", "Sources of Bludgeoning damage", "Bugs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">For the passive feature, see <a href=\"/wiki/Tenacity_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Tenacity (passive feature)\">Tenacity (passive feature)</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tenacity.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Tenacity.webp/300px-Tenacity.webp, /w/images/b/bd/Tenacity.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Tenacity.webp/300px-Tenacity.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/Tenacity.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b> Tenacity </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon action\">weapon action</a> available to characters <a href=\"/wiki/Proficient\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficient\">proficient</a> in and wielding a <a href=\"/wiki/Flails\" title=\"Flails\">flail</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Morningstars\" title=\"Morningstars\">morningstar</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Greatclubs\" title=\"Greatclubs\">greatclub</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/Mauls\" title=\"Mauls\">maul</a> in their main hand.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nWhen you miss an attack, deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a> damage equal to your <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_scores#Ability_score_modifiers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability scores\">modifier</a> anyway (minimum of 1).<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/28px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/42px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/28px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a></dd><dt>Damage</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\"><a href=\"/wiki/Strength#Strength_modifier_chart\" title=\"Strength\">Strength modifier</a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a></div></div></div></dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Interrupt_Overwhelm</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_Overwhelm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_Overwhelm\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by wielding the following weapon types with <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a>:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flails\" title=\"Flails\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Flails_Icon.png/25px-Flails_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Flails_Icon.png/38px-Flails_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Flails_Icon.png/50px-Flails_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flails\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Flails_Icon.png/25px-Flails_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Flails_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flails\" title=\"Flails\">Flails</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Morningstars\" title=\"Morningstars\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Morningstars_Icon.png/25px-Morningstars_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Morningstars_Icon.png/38px-Morningstars_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Morningstars_Icon.png/50px-Morningstars_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Morningstars\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Morningstars_Icon.png/25px-Morningstars_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/65/Morningstars_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Morningstars\" title=\"Morningstars\">Morningstars</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Greatclubs\" title=\"Greatclubs\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Greatclubs_Icon.png/25px-Greatclubs_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Greatclubs_Icon.png/38px-Greatclubs_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Greatclubs_Icon.png/50px-Greatclubs_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Greatclubs\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Greatclubs_Icon.png/25px-Greatclubs_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a8/Greatclubs_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Greatclubs\" title=\"Greatclubs\">Greatclubs</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mauls\" title=\"Mauls\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Mauls_Icon.png/25px-Mauls_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Mauls_Icon.png/38px-Mauls_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Mauls_Icon.png/50px-Mauls_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mauls\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Mauls_Icon.png/25px-Mauls_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d2/Mauls_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mauls\" title=\"Mauls\">Mauls</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>If a <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon action\">weapon action</a> misses, using Tenacity will not trigger its effects.</li>\n<li>Despite being greatclubs, neither <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rat_Bat\" title=\"Rat Bat\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Greatclub_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Greatclub_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Greatclub_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Greatclub_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Greatclub_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Greatclub_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Greatclub_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Greatclub_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Greatclub_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rat_Bat\" title=\"Rat Bat\">Rat Bat</a> nor <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Punch-Drunk_Bastard\" title=\"Punch-Drunk Bastard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Greatclub_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Punch-Drunk_Bastard\" title=\"Punch-Drunk Bastard\">Punch-Drunk Bastard</a> provide Tenacity. The <a href=\"/wiki/Air_Myrmidon\" title=\"Air Myrmidon\">Air Myrmidon's</a> <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flail_of_the_Vortex\" title=\"Flail of the Vortex\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Flail_of_the_Vortex_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Flail_of_the_Vortex_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Flail_of_the_Vortex_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Flail_of_the_Vortex_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Flail_of_the_Vortex_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Flail_of_the_Vortex_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Flail_of_the_Vortex_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Flail_of_the_Vortex_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Flail_of_the_Vortex_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flail_of_the_Vortex\" title=\"Flail of the Vortex\">Flail of the Vortex</a> also lacks Tenacity.</li>\n<li>As Tenacity deals weapon damage, even if an attack misses, it can trigger many on-hit effects from equipment.\n<ul><li>Effects like weapon coatings, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Power\" title=\"Gloves of Power\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Power\" title=\"Gloves of Power\">Gloves of Power</a>, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Callous_Glow_Ring\" title=\"Callous Glow Ring\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/51/Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/51/Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/51/Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Callous_Glow_Ring\" title=\"Callous Glow Ring\">Callous Glow Ring</a>, and any infusion from <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Elemental_Infusion\" title=\"Ring of Elemental Infusion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Elemental_Infusion\" title=\"Ring of Elemental Infusion\">Ring of Elemental Infusion</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Doom_Hammer\" title=\"Doom Hammer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Maul_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Maul_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Maul_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Maul_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Maul_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Maul_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Maul_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Maul_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Maul_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Doom_Hammer\" title=\"Doom Hammer\">Doom Hammer</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Sacred_Star\" title=\"The Sacred Star\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Morningstar_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Morningstar_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Morningstar_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Morningstar_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Morningstar_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Morningstar_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Morningstar_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Morningstar_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Morningstar_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Sacred_Star\" title=\"The Sacred Star\">The Sacred Star</a> on-hit effects will be triggered. This is particularly important when you need to apply a condition consistently, like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bone_Chilled_(Condition)\" title=\"Bone Chilled (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Bone_Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Bone_Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Bone_Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bone_Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Bone_Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Bone_Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bone Chilled\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Bone_Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Bone_Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Bone_Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bone_Chilled_(Condition)\" title=\"Bone Chilled (Condition)\">Bone Chilled</a> to a powerful undead or fast-healing enemy.</li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flail_of_Ages\" title=\"Flail of Ages\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Flail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Flail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/Flail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Flail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/Flail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Flail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Flail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Flail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cd/Flail_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flail_of_Ages\" title=\"Flail of Ages\">Flail of Ages</a> can trigger its effect via Tenacity when boosted by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid_Infusion_(Condition)\" title=\"Acid Infusion (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid Infusion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1d/Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Acid_Infusion_(Condition)\" title=\"Acid Infusion (Condition)\">Acid Infusion</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold_Infusion_(Condition)\" title=\"Cold Infusion (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold Infusion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1c/Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cold_Infusion_(Condition)\" title=\"Cold Infusion (Condition)\">Cold Infusion</a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Infusion_(Condition)\" title=\"Fire Infusion (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire Infusion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Infusion_(Condition)\" title=\"Fire Infusion (Condition)\">Fire Infusion</a>.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>When dual wielding a flail or morningstar with a non-Tenacity weapon using the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dual_Wielder\" title=\"Dual Wielder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Dual_Wielder_Icon.webp/20px-Dual_Wielder_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Dual_Wielder_Icon.webp/30px-Dual_Wielder_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Dual_Wielder_Icon.webp/40px-Dual_Wielder_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dual Wielder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Dual_Wielder_Icon.webp/20px-Dual_Wielder_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0f/Dual_Wielder_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dual_Wielder\" title=\"Dual Wielder\">Dual Wielder</a> feat, Tenacity can be triggered by missing an attack with the non-Tenacity weapon. The damage will always be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a>, no matter the weapon used.\n<ul><li>Some non-Tenacity weapons can trigger their on-hit effects via Tenacity as well, such as the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Dagger\" title=\"Ritual Dagger\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/61/Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Dagger\" title=\"Ritual Dagger\">Ritual Dagger</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Loviatar%27s_Scourge\" title=\"Loviatar's Scourge\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Mace_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Mace_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Mace_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Mace_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Mace_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Mace_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Mace_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Mace_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Mace_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Loviatar%27s_Scourge\" title=\"Loviatar's Scourge\">Loviatar's Scourge</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li>As <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Horde_Breaker_(Melee)\" title=\"Horde Breaker (Melee)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Horde_Breaker_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Horde_Breaker_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Horde_Breaker_Melee_Icon.webp/30px-Horde_Breaker_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Horde_Breaker_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Horde_Breaker_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Horde Breaker (Melee)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Horde_Breaker_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Horde_Breaker_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e1/Horde_Breaker_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Horde_Breaker_(Melee)\" title=\"Horde Breaker (Melee)\">Horde Breaker (Melee)</a> rolls invisible, zero-damage weapon attacks against all enemies in the Horde Breaker area of effect, Tenacity can be prompted to trigger against them even if the first attack hits. It is therefore possible to score 2 hits in one attack: the full attack against the original Horde Breaker target and a Tenacity hit against another target.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034953\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.148 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.158 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 8316/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 86056/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 39875/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 23/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 10/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.088/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1775328/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  135.066      1 -total\n 99.72%  134.689      1 Template:Feature_page\n 49.61%   67.000    121 Template:Trim\n 39.75%   53.695     11 Templat